{"question_id": "kaoyan_math3_2024_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math3_2024", "exam_type": "math3", "year": 2024, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "连续性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math3_2024_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math3_2024_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "stem": "设函数\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{1+x}{1+n x^{2n}},\n$$\n则 $f(x)$（  ）\n\nA. 在 $x=1$，$x=-1$ 处都连续。\n\nB. 在 $x=1$ 处连续，在 $x=-1$ 处不连续。\n\nC. 在 $x=1$，$x=-1$ 处都不连续。\n\nD. 在 $x=1$ 处不连续，在 $x=-1$ 处连续。", "answer": "D", "explanation": "当 $|x|<1$ 时，$x^{2n}\\to0$，故 $f(x)=1+x$；当 $|x|>1$ 时，$n x^{2n}\\to\\infty$，故 $f(x)=0$。又 $f(1)=0$，$f(-1)=0$，所以 $f$ 在 $x=-1$ 处连续，在 $x=1$ 处不连续，选 D。", "methods": []}
